{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25935","headline":"将归旧山留别孟郊 · 鲍溶","name":"将归旧山留别孟郊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"择木无利刃，羡鱼无巧纶。\n如何不量力，自取中路贫。\n前者不厌耕，一日不离亲。\n今来千里外，我心不在身。\n悠悠慈母心，惟愿才如人。\n蚕桑能几许，衣服常着新。\n一饭吐尺丝，谁见此殷勤。\n别君归耕去，持火烧车轮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}